cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AlphaSDM in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "AlphaSDM: Species Distribution Modeling using Alpha Earth Embeddings"
abstract: >-
  An R package for species distribution modeling at up to 10 m resolution using
  Google's Alpha Earth satellite embeddings. Data sampling, model training and
  spatial prediction all run server-side on Google Earth Engine.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: James
    family-names: Longo
    email: james.longo.birds@gmail.com
    affiliation: University of Maine
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/James-Longo/AlphaSDM"
url: "https://github.com/James-Longo/AlphaSDM"
keywords:
  - species distribution modeling
  - google earth engine
  - satellite embeddings
  - remote sensing
  - ecology
